<title>FINLAND: INTERIM REPORTS - FINNISH FORECASTS AND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>INTERIM REPORTS - FINNISH FORECASTS AND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a list of forecasts</p>
<p>for and outcome of big Finnish companies latest interim results</p>
<p>in 1996.</p>
<p>For companies, the table refers to profit after financial</p>
<p>items but before extraordinary items (for Nokia, it is profit</p>
<p>before tax and minorities). For banks, this is operating profit</p>
<p>after credit losses.</p>
<p>The list will be updated as reports and forecasts are</p>
<p>published.</p>
<p>(Figs million markka)</p>
<p>SIX-MONTH RESULT (to end-September 1996)</p>
<p>	     Median forecast  Result  Comparison 1995  Result due</p>
<p> Finnair	292		 N/A	 463	     29/11</p>
